    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/1ef0cca12a324f896c17a1e7ef8bd050.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/1ef0cca12a324f896c17a1e7ef8bd050.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A game with cute kittens in a fantastic adventure</strong> specially created for you to relax, be inspired and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/ea80269cbbe7e793ba9c5ec935a8283b.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/ea80269cbbe7e793ba9c5ec935a8283b.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The arts of Hidden Shapes - Cat Realm are inspired by the world of medieval kittens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be amazed by the minimalist style and beautiful art of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/cf05115d4f61cd128bcce0d61f04ae25.avif?t=1729020317\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax with these beautiful hand-drawn jigsaw puzzles and forget about your worries following the adventure of our dear kittens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/d033c1a7dc6b1a2c5b91f03dc68e4ad8.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/d033c1a7dc6b1a2c5b91f03dc68e4ad8.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So that you can have fun and enjoy the game more, after solving a puzzle the complete art will be released, so at any time you can have fun again solving the entire puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Steam Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to follow us on the Steam page so you'll know about new games and news from the studio.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/1ef0cca12a324f896c17a1e7ef8bd050.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/1ef0cca12a324f896c17a1e7ef8bd050.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A game with cute kittens in a fantastic adventure</strong> specially created for you to relax, be inspired and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/ea80269cbbe7e793ba9c5ec935a8283b.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/ea80269cbbe7e793ba9c5ec935a8283b.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The arts of Hidden Shapes - Cat Realm are inspired by the world of medieval kittens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be amazed by the minimalist style and beautiful art of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/cf05115d4f61cd128bcce0d61f04ae25.avif?t=1729020317\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax with these beautiful hand-drawn jigsaw puzzles and forget about your worries following the adventure of our dear kittens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/d033c1a7dc6b1a2c5b91f03dc68e4ad8.poster.avif?t=1729020317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143290/extras/d033c1a7dc6b1a2c5b91f03dc68e4ad8.webm?t=1729020317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So that you can have fun and enjoy the game more, after solving a puzzle the complete art will be released, so at any time you can have fun again solving the entire puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Steam Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to follow us on the Steam page so you'll know about new games and news from the studio.</p>",
    "short_description": "The hero kitty sets out on an epic quest to save the princess from a dragon's clutches! Relax and have fun following the story and solving beautiful hand-drawn puzzles in a world of adventurous kittens. A beautiful puzzle created to delight you and rescue your tranquility.",
